    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/73c52520796794e3648791805c704056.avif?t=1751377293\" data-has-big width=800 height=1106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zegelon: Hardcore Arena</strong> blends intense multiplayer shoot-and-slash combat with battle royale, survival and management mechanics. In this dark post-apocalyptic fantasy world, players engage in brutal gladiatorial combat with no second chances, crafting characters in the spirit of old-school roleplaying games. While expanding their House in the hierarchy of the rising Empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/d198fc693d5c7ffb7907d358be85368e.poster.avif?t=1751377293\" width=620 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/d198fc693d5c7ffb7907d358be85368e.webm?t=1751377293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/d198fc693d5c7ffb7907d358be85368e.mp4?t=1751377293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/595e349c7608490d0d48b8e29ca96574.avif?t=1751377293\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/4ef565cc541f9cb6fa553665c94893b9.avif?t=1751377293\" data-has-big width=800 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Dark Post-Apocalyptic Fantasy World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a savage world where desperate prisoners fight for survival under the gaze of the tyrannical rising Empire. Dive into a dark, unforgiving world where Houses rise, Legends fall, and Gold and Glory awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/880a78d9892da7fe81262c6a9c609156.poster.avif?t=1751377293\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/880a78d9892da7fe81262c6a9c609156.webm?t=1751377293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/880a78d9892da7fe81262c6a9c609156.mp4?t=1751377293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/6b57e2b7218f57b5f13357d2e3a62297.avif?t=1751377293\" width=680 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/dca48183cd3e4b35a35820f1e80dce94.avif?t=1751377293\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/cb9ba9b0efa662df0b89bda2545b785c.poster.avif?t=1751377293\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/cb9ba9b0efa662df0b89bda2545b785c.webm?t=1751377293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/cb9ba9b0efa662df0b89bda2545b785c.mp4?t=1751377293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chance Creates Fighters, Strategy Creates Legends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the Dice of Fate to buy your prisoners, shape their destiny through strategic upgrades and Arena victories. No two fighters are alike\u2014adapt your tactics and outsmart your rivals to dominate the Arena.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/854406608c76e09198811a1fa1b12ced.poster.avif?t=1751377293\" width=620 height=620 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/854406608c76e09198811a1fa1b12ced.webm?t=1751377293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/854406608c76e09198811a1fa1b12ced.mp4?t=1751377293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/263254e14c013af919767af2a5980f89.poster.avif?t=1751377293\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/263254e14c013af919767af2a5980f89.webm?t=1751377293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/263254e14c013af919767af2a5980f89.mp4?t=1751377293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Permanent Character Death</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle is a life-or-death experience\u2014there are no second chances. The tension of every encounter is unmatched, making each fight a heart-pounding experience where only the best survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/ee6263bc499e1ea34be6ddcbaa994bc7.poster.avif?t=1751377293\" width=620 height=620 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/ee6263bc499e1ea34be6ddcbaa994bc7.webm?t=1751377293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/ee6263bc499e1ea34be6ddcbaa994bc7.mp4?t=1751377293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill-Based and Brutal Combat System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is visceral, skill-based, and punishing\u2014timing and positioning is key. True skill separates the fighters from the weak; every move, parry, and strike can mean life or death. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/f4cfdfb6ea86eec802862b5ed2effb59.avif?t=1751377293\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/9ff5d0656c024b98e9becebc5905ad19.poster.avif?t=1751377293\" width=620 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/9ff5d0656c024b98e9becebc5905ad19.webm?t=1751377293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/9ff5d0656c024b98e9becebc5905ad19.mp4?t=1751377293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Arenas of Zegelon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Empire's Arena League has transformed ancient Arenas and sacred sites of conquered strongholds into battlegrounds of chaos and bloodshed. Prisoners thrust into merciless rituals, forced to survive not only each other but also relentless beasts and deadly hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/e81166da6a1d16e110c0a744cc8521ed.avif?t=1751377293\" width=620 height=482 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/712f2cfe2f288699967ddf2bd573e26b.avif?t=1751377293\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/396667031ebfe1ae4475b3018eb3bc2c.poster.avif?t=1751377293\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/396667031ebfe1ae4475b3018eb3bc2c.webm?t=1751377293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/396667031ebfe1ae4475b3018eb3bc2c.mp4?t=1751377293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632070/extras/8b27519c96dd02daaf1b5ec0751ddfa4.avif?t=1751377293\" width=620 height=650 /></span></p>",
